## Agent state

- At session start in a git repo, run `~/.local/bin/agent-state hook` and read the output. It is this workstream's saved state; it prints nothing when there is none.
- Before ending with unfinished work, follow `~/.agents/skills/handoff/SKILL.md`.
- Write plans and specs into the workstream's `phases/NN-name/` dir (`agent-state dir <workstream>`), not the project repo.

## Approval required

- Never post public comments, create Linear issues, or deploy without explicit approval.
- Open PRs as drafts only.
